Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:16.24,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:16.24,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}斯瓦泰克 vs 莱巴金娜 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,It's always a huge disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这总是让人非常失望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when an opponent has to retire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,当对手不得不
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.38,EN,,0,0,0,,from a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,退出比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not the kind of win that you want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这不是任何人想看到的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was feeling anxious just looking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,老实说 光是看着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.70,EN,,0,0,0,,at this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个情况我就很焦虑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:16.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So I hope Elena will be fine and obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我希望伊莲娜没事 显然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the next tournament is the priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,下一站赛事才是重点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I know this one is important as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道这一站也很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.50,EN,,0,0,0,,but US Open is US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但美网就是美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and I hope she's going to be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我希望她能准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,for that because she's also super close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她现在也非常接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to being number one in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.10,EN,,0,0,0,,So it's a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.70,EN,,0,0,0,,because I felt we were playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得我们本来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.36,EN,,0,0,0,,a good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:39.12,EN,,0,0,0,,But health is a priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但健康更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.22,EN,,0,0,0,,so I hope she's going to be okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我希望她会没事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.42,EN,,0,0,0,,We do, we hope she's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也希望她会没事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And if Elena's listening,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果伊莲娜正在听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,we do wish you a speedy recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:46.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's take this opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们就借这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:48.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to spend a couple of minutes with you, talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,再和你聊几分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,about the kind of tennis you're playing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,谈谈你现在的网球状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.82,EN,,0,0,0,,You seem that you're in a zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好像进入了自己的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:52.54,EN,,0,0,0,,you're in a good place,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个人状态很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:54.84,EN,,0,0,0,,a smile when you walk out on court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,走上球场时也带着笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,you're back here as defending champion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你以卫冕冠军身份回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.90,EN,,0,0,0,,to the heart of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到网球之心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.28,EN,,0,0,0,,How special to be back here in Mason,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,再回到俄亥俄州梅森
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Ohio?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,有多特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我感觉很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:07.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel ready to play my best game
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好拿出最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:11.14,EN,,0,0,0,,and the last weeks have been giving me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,最近几周也给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:15.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm happy to be here playing good tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴能在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:19.90,EN,,0,0,0,,that I like and I enjoy and for sure it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.32,0:01:19.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,打自己喜欢的网球 享受比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we have not till 8 30 until
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 男单要到八点半才上场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:22.38,EN,,0,0,0,,the guys come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,So can you and I play singles for a little
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,要不要和我打一会儿单打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:27.16,EN,,0,0,0,,while and you can help me with my volume?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:27.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,顺便帮我练练嗓门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Just got to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,总得问问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:29.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:30.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Will you sign some tennis balls for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,能帮我们签几个网球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Before you do real quick, Jessica Pegula,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,签之前 快问一句 佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:33.98,EN,,0,0,0,,you've played her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:33.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们交手过很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You know her game very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很熟悉她的打法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.74,EN,,0,0,0,,She's tough. You're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,她很难缠 你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,What do we have in store
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,看你们交手时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.32,EN,,0,0,0,,when we watch you play Jessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们会看到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, she's a great competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是个很棒的竞争者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:45.46,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like we've been on Tour for...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.86,0:01:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想我们在巡回赛很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,We've been playing many matches
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们已经打过很多场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,where we had our best games like clashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,两人状态最佳时正面碰上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And it's always such a tough match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,每次都是非常艰难的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It went both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,彼此都赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Many three-setters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,也多次打满三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm excited to play this match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很期待这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,because for sure it's going to be a challenge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为对我来说一定会是挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,She has a great game for hard courts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的打法很适合硬地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, it's going to be a good semi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一定会是一场精彩的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,肯定会很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,All right. We wish you best of luck
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 祝你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.22,EN,,0,0,0,,in the semis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:10.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,半决赛好运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to Cincy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.22,0:02:11.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Your defending champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请你们的卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:13.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Everyone, Iga Swiatek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,各位 伊加·斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's get some autographed tennis balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.72,0:02:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,来签几个网球吧
